# Pre-push checklist

Before creating any git commit or push in this project, always run:

```bash
npm run build
```

A passing build confirms TypeScript compiles and Next.js can bundle every page. This catches type errors on files not directly edited (e.g. adding a required field to a shared type breaks callers elsewhere).

If the build fails, fix all errors before committing. Do not push a broken build.
